{"id":"644120","name":"五彩炒饭","author":"筠旸JY","authorId":"7345450","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/644120/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米饭","amount":"一碗"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"笋丁","amount":"适量"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"香菇提前泡软洗净，和胡萝卜菜笋洋葱均切成小丁。","img":"images/644120/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"剩米饭备用。","img":"images/644120/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡蛋打散炒成鸡蛋碎盛出备用。","img":"images/644120/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"热锅凉油，先放入胡萝卜洋葱翻炒均匀。","img":"images/644120/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"再把香菇笋丁放进去继续翻炒几下。","img":"images/644120/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入米饭，用铲子压碎，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/644120/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入炒好的鸡蛋。","img":"images/644120/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加一点点生抽调味。","img":"images/644120/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"少许盐。","img":"images/644120/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"继续翻炒均匀即可出锅。","img":"images/644120/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"装盘上桌啦！","img":"images/644120/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图！","img":"images/644120/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图！","img":"images/644120/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}